Theorem CH-comp-PV: Provenance-partition side-table extension of the composition theorems CH-comp, PL-comp, and VF-comp

  Preconditions:
    - Invariant-5 admission avenue (c): the AIMS unified model admits a new
      capability as a typed pre-pass input landing beside the lattice state
      map (like the immortals bitvector) - never a new lattice dimension,
      never a parallel emission path. The provenance PARTITION (the T1
      birth-site union-find class map: a value's computed representative)
      enters exactly this way: computed by a Phase-5 pre-pass, consumed at
      burden-op sites as the classOf side table the T2 ledger engine already
      takes AS GIVEN. Table-class equality is provably the computed T1
      sameRep verdict, so the table carries no partition notion of its own.
    - The committed composition theorems were proven WITHOUT the partition
      input: CH-comp (coexistence-handshake union over CH-1..CH-5,
      aims-proof/proofs/11-coexistence/CH-comp.proof), PL-comp (pipeline
      composition over PL-1..PL-11, aims-proof/proofs/07-pipeline/
      PL-comp.proof), VF-comp (verification-stack composition over
      VF-1..VF-8, aims-proof/proofs/09-verification/VF-comp.proof). The
      extension obligation: each composition still holds when the partition
      side table is threaded as a typed input, BECAUSE the table is
      read-only relative to the composed structure - it refines elimination
      and verification decisions at class grain, never mutates the state
      map, never spawns an emission path beside the lattice.
    - The refined elimination verdict is the committed CH-2 consumer verdict
      GATED on the partition class's keep bit: the refinement can only KEEP
      or DECLINE an elimination the lattice already licensed. The gating
      shape is the subset discipline; a general subset-HYPOTHESIS form
      covers any refined eliminator whose fires are within the committed
      eliminate set (the lattice stays the optimizer authority per the AIMS
      conflict rule; the DP-2 / DP-3 decision predicates are reused
      verbatim through the committed eliminate conjunction).
    - The partition pre-pass occupies the analyze -> realize gap (computed
      AFTER analyze_function - it reads the converged state map - and
      BEFORE realize_rc_reuse, its first consumer), mirroring the CH-5
      burden-pre-pass sequencing shape; modeled through the committed PL-6
      admissible-insertion shift at the realize cut plus the committed PL-5
      summary-flow non-staleness form.
    - The partition-aware verification layer checks class-grain net-zero
      (T2's clause 1 over the derived per-class ledger) - checkable only
      with the side table in hand; layered onto the committed stack as an
      appended per-layer verdict.
    - The compiled Lean model is the calculus authority for the extension;
      conformance of the shipped emitter to the model is established
      empirically on the compiler's ARC-verified test surface, not here.

  Soundness property:
    Forall partition side table and forall class-grain keep function:

      (P1) CH extension. The refined burden-derived and refined
        lattice-derived verdicts are THE SAME boolean per (var, state)
        program point (CH-2 single-elimination preserved under class-grain
        refinement); the refined verdict set is a SUBSET of the lattice
        verdict set and lands inside the DP-2 / DP-3 verdict-eliminable
        set; the refined emitted-op set selects WITHIN the committed
        emitted set (no parallel emission); the table-consulting consumer
        returns the frozen state map UNCHANGED per event and under
        whole-sequence replay (CH-4 preserved); and the extended handshake
        accepts iff every layer INCLUDING the appended partition layer
        accepts (the CH-comp union keeps its teeth: a false partition
        verdict rejects; a committed-layer failure still rejects with the
        layer appended).
      (P2) PL extension. The committed PL-comp conjunction re-discharges
        verbatim with the pre-pass inserted at its slot; every committed
        before-pair survives the PL-6 insertion shift at the partition cut;
        the pre-pass sits strictly inside the analyze -> realize gap
        (producer before consumer, no back-edge); and every partition-table
        summary flow reads strictly after its production (no stale-summary
        violation). A pre-pass slotted AFTER its consumer is provably a
        stale read.
      (P3) VF extension. The extended stack accepts iff every committed
        layer AND the partition layer accept; the new layer only ever
        REJECTS MORE (an extended accept implies the base accept - it never
        accepts a shape a prior layer rejects); a committed-layer failure
        still rejects with the layer appended; the extended catch map
        remains a complete pairwise-distinct partition over the extended
        failure-class universe; and the layer has teeth on the committed K1
        past-merge double-free (class-grain net-zero fails; the extended
        stack rejects a shape every committed layer accepted).
      (P4) The discipline has teeth (the invariant-5 parallel-path ban,
        machine-checked). A rogue class-grain eliminator consulting ONLY
        the partition fires on a Borrowed state the committed lattice
        verdict refuses: its verdict set is NOT a subset of the lattice set
        and its verdict DIVERGES from the lattice verdict at that program
        point (a second elimination authority - the double-free shape). A
        WRITING consumer that inserts into the state map provably breaks
        the CH-4 leg (the map changes; a per-variable lookup diverges).

  Proof obligation:
    (P1) Discharged parametrically over the table and keep function by
         composing the committed CH-2 identity (CH2_single_elimination),
         the committed emitted-set membership characterization
         (CH2_emission_order_independent), the committed CH-4 immutability
         (CH4_state_map_immutable, CH4_replay_immutable), and the committed
         CH-comp union characterization (CHcomp_accepts_iff_all,
         CHcomp_any_layer_fails_rejects); instantiated at the committed T1
         loop-CFG union-find (pfUF): the refined verdict fires at the
         singleton-admitted items-header node, declines at the label-merge
         node the T1 kill-criterion kept split - while the lattice verdict
         still fires - and table-class equality is the computed sameRep
         verdict (class_eq_iff_sameRep).
    (P2) Discharged by re-invoking the committed PLcomp_pipeline_composes
         verbatim, the committed PL6_insertion_preserves_order at the
         partition cut, the committed PL2_analyze_before_realize anchor,
         and the committed PL5_no_stale_summaries ALL-reads form over the
         concrete partition flow list.
    (P3) Discharged through the committed VFcomp_stack_accepts_iff_all,
         VFcomp_any_layer_fails_stack_rejects, VFcomp_all_pass_accepted,
         VFcomp_layers_catch_distinct, and VFcomp_every_class_caught, with
         the layer verdict computed by the committed deriveLedger +
         clauseNetZero over the committed K1 structures (k1Cured,
         k1PastMerge, k1ClassOf, T2_K1_cured_clauses).
    (P4) Discharged by the committed CH2_borrowed_not_eliminated negative
         witness (the rogue fires where the lattice refuses; the subset and
         single-elimination legs both break) and by computed lookup
         divergence for the writing consumer, contrasted against the
         committed CH4_state_map_immutable at the same instance.

