  Expected:
    status: unimplemented_engine_shape
    reason: CH composition-extension shape outside the rule-numbered CH verifier inventory (the CH dischargers serve the CH-1..CH-5 and CH-comp suffixes only). The authoritative machine-check is the compiled Lean AimsProof.ProvenanceComposition (lake build clean): CHcomp_partition_side_table discharges the coexistence-handshake extension (refined single-elimination, subset-of-lattice verdicts, within-committed emitted set, state-map immutability with the table consulted, appended-layer union), PLcomp_partition_side_table re-discharges the committed pipeline conjunction with the partition pre-pass in the analyze-realize gap under non-stale summary flows, VFcomp_partition_side_table layers the class-grain net-zero conformance check onto the committed stack (rejects-more, never accepts-more), and the rogue outside-the-lattice-set eliminator plus the state-map-writing consumer are provably rejected - the provenance partition threaded as a typed read-only side-table input per invariant 5 avenue (c).
